E=/home/user/Nicole-projects/elevenlabs/el.py
ST="Stylized 3D cartoon animation like a family animated feature film, vertical 9:16, smooth expressive character animation, consistent characters exactly as in the first frame. The macaw keeps the same beige bucket hat with its patch facing forward. Cinematic but simple camera movement."
NEG="realistic, photorealistic, text, letters, subtitles, captions, watermark, distorted face, extra limbs, extra fingers, hands on the macaw, two boxes, morphing objects, flicker"
v(){ o=$1; d=$2; s=$3; p=$4; [ -s vid/$o.mp4 ] && return; python3 $E video "$ST $p" -o vid/$o.mp4 --ar 9:16 --dur $d --res 4K --start $s --neg "$NEG" > vid/$o.log 2>&1; }
v e01 6 sv_01.png "Snow falls gently at night. The man stands under the streetlight looking down at his phone, the screen glow on his sad face; he slowly exhales a puff of steam and his eyes get a little wet. Very slow push-in. Ambient: soft wind, distant city." &
v e02 8 sv_02.png "Warm sunrise kitchen. The macaw on the window sill shakes his feathers, adjusts his hat with one wing and says cheerfully in Spanish with a Latin American accent: \"Este año, la encomienda va al revés.\" Below, the woman looks up at him smiling, holding the empty box. Ambient: morning birds, a rooster far away." &
v e03 8 sv_03.png "Coffee farm in the misty mountains. The farmer hands the paper bag of coffee to the macaw; the macaw sniffs it, closes his eyes blissfully and floats gently up off the ground on a swirl of coffee aroma, cartoon style, then lands softly. Ambient: birds, leaves." &
v e04 8 sv_04.png "Bakery. The macaw quickly hides the rosquilla behind his back with an innocent smile; the lady above stares at him suspiciously over her glasses; the macaw sweats, gives up, and slowly places the rosquilla back on the tray with a guilty grin. Comedic timing. Ambient: shop sounds." &
v e05 8 sv_05.png "Neighborhood afternoon. The family poses and laughs; the kids make funny faces; the macaw raises the vintage camera and takes the photo: a bright flash pops; everybody laughs together. Ambient: laughter, camera click." &
wait
v e06 8 sv_06.png "Night kitchen, warm lamp. The woman records a voice message on her phone with her hand on her chest, emotional, lips moving softly (we do not hear the words); she places the nacatamal into the single box; the macaw on the table ties the box with the rope into a bow. Ambient: quiet night crickets." &
v e07 6 sv_07.png "Inside an airplane at night. The macaw sits buckled in the window seat hugging the tied box, looks out the window as clouds pass and the first snowflakes appear outside, then hugs the box a little tighter. Gentle airplane hum." &
v e08 8 sv_08.png "Airport customs. The serious officer leans down and asks in English: \"Anything to declare?\" The macaw smiles innocently and answers in Spanish with a Latin American accent: \"Solo amor... y un nacatamal.\" The officer sniffs the air, can't help smiling, and waves him through. Ambient: airport murmur." &
v e09 8 sv_09.png "Apartment hallway at night. The tired man walks in, stops, notices the tied box in front of his door, looks around confused; in the snowy window above, the macaw peeks in and quickly ducks to hide. Ambient: quiet hallway, wind outside." &
v e10 8 sv_10.png "Small blue-lit apartment. The man opens the box; warm golden light glows on his face; he smells the coffee and closes his eyes; he picks up the family photo, laughs and a tear rolls down his cheek. Ambient: quiet room, soft wind." &
wait
v e11a 8 sv_11.png "Christmas Eve kitchen. The woman sits at the table looking at the empty chair with its served plate; she smiles with quiet tears and gently touches the back of the empty chair. Very slow push-in. Ambient: distant Christmas fireworks, soft night." &
v e11b 8 sv_11.png "Christmas Eve kitchen. Slow camera move toward the empty chair and its served plate while the woman, softly out of focus, wipes a tear and smiles. Candles of the nativity scene flicker. Ambient: quiet night." &
v e12 6 sv_12.png "Small apartment at night. The man hugs the framed photo to his chest, eyes wet, and whispers in Spanish: \"Gracias, mamá.\" Behind him outside the window the macaw gives a thumbs-up with his wing, then turns and flies away into the falling snow; tiny fireworks in the distance." &
v e13 8 sv_13.png "Night sky over a snowy city. The macaw flies forward joyfully toward the warm golden horizon where tropical mountains and palm trees appear; colorful fireworks bloom softly; the camera follows him and tilts up to the calm open sky." &
